  "id": "a-note-from-aglaea",
  "name": "A Note from Aglaea",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/A_Note_from_Aglaea",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-11T05:51:38.089Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dear they (Trailblazer),"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I once threaded needles through the world's changes, trying to weave a beautiful destiny."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We chased the flames in solitude, until the ashen light descended from beyond the sky."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Now, I rarely set aside my heavy loom to weave for myself,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "yet you are about to depart, your fading traces beyond even the reach of silk threads."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The ornament I gifted you bears no divine essence. It was handcrafted by me, something I had cherished and carried everywhere."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "For I wished not to make it weighty, but rather like a feather resting on your wrist,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "adorning your form, illuminating your soul."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Even I cannot see the future you will step into, I shall pray for you."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Trailblaze weaves star rails that intertwine like silk strings for this universe."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "May those silver strings guide your way and resonate for you."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Aglaea"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
